WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.467 --> 00:00:02.635
-I know it's your favorite job,
but you also told me

00:00:02.635 --> 00:00:04.336
it's the most dangerous job
you ever did.

00:00:04.336 --> 00:00:06.472
-Yeah.
So many accidents.

00:00:06.472 --> 00:00:09.976
I got chased by bees,
hit by a car, season 1.

00:00:09.976 --> 00:00:11.444
Got a concussion
during season 1

00:00:11.444 --> 00:00:13.079
because I saw a cookie
on the ground,

00:00:13.079 --> 00:00:14.813
and I was like --
I have a 30-day rule.

00:00:14.813 --> 00:00:16.415
And I was like,
"I'm gonna...

00:00:16.415 --> 00:00:17.784
I'm gonna eat
that cookie."

00:00:17.784 --> 00:00:20.286
And I just reached, forcefully,
to go and get the cookie,

00:00:20.286 --> 00:00:22.021
and knocked myself out
on my side table.

00:00:22.021 --> 00:00:25.124
Had a concussion. Had seizures
for, like, three months.

00:00:25.124 --> 00:00:26.893
I...

00:00:26.893 --> 00:00:28.260
I rolled my ankle.

00:00:28.260 --> 00:00:30.163
I broke my arm.

00:00:30.163 --> 00:00:32.331
None of which was on set,
just during filming.

00:00:32.331 --> 00:00:35.368
And then, finally,
we had a giant action scene

00:00:35.368 --> 00:00:37.603
in season 3, where we have to
fight all these demons.

00:00:37.603 --> 00:00:39.772
And they gave every single
other character --

00:00:39.772 --> 00:00:42.909
including 70-year-old Ted --
action to do,

00:00:42.909 --> 00:00:45.411
and made me just sit behind
a pool table, and watch,

00:00:45.411 --> 00:00:47.713
because they said it was
the only thing I was safe doing.

00:00:47.713 --> 00:00:49.516
At the end of this
three-day shoot

00:00:49.516 --> 00:00:51.451
of me crouching behind
a pool table,

00:00:51.451 --> 00:00:54.554
I pull a muscle in my ass
while down there,

00:00:54.554 --> 00:00:57.657
and remain the only member
of the cast

00:00:57.657 --> 00:00:59.392
who sustained an injury.
-You were supposed to be safe.

00:00:59.392 --> 00:01:00.492
[ Both laugh ]

00:01:00.492 --> 00:01:01.994
And they're all
doing action?

00:01:01.994 --> 00:01:03.796
-Yeah. They're, like, fighting
with pool cues, and everything.

00:01:03.796 --> 00:01:06.566
I did nothing, and broke my ass.
-Oh, that's not good.

